https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL

The upstream Apache-2.0 license is included in licenses/QWEN_LICENSE.txt.

The evaluation sample identities and temporal MOS labels in test_videos.csv
originate from the LGVQ dataset. Original videos are available from its authors.
https://github.com/zczhang-sjtu/UGVQ
